@content
Welcome to Rhythermia Wiki.

Rhythermia is a platformer rhythm bullet-hell game about a lil' guy named Kuro, who is trying to stop Zyro from his obsession of wanting to own Kuromatria. The main goal of the game is to dodge everything that's about to appear until the music ends. similar to Just Shapes and Beats or Project Arrhythmia or just any dodging-rhythm game ever... with platformer physics thrown in.

You can download the game in itch.io, IndieDB, or Gamejolt.

This wiki serve as a lore, tricks to beat a level, or unlocking character. So don't expect much stuff from this wiki.

